  "title": "Crispy Thin Fried Green Tomatoes",
  "description": "Even the pickiest eaters will enjoy this delicious recipe for crispy thin fried green tomatoes, coated in crushed cornflakes and fried until delicious.",
  "authors": [
    "Angela Stinnett"
  ],
